# Embrella Deposition — Backend Design

## App Location
`umbrella/depositions/` — sibling to `processes/`, `workflow/`, `tem/`, `users/`.

---

## Models (`umbrella/depositions/models.py`)

### Deposition
Top-level container. **No status field** — status is per-dataset; deposition-level status is derived from its datasets if needed.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `deposition_id` | `IntegerField(null=True, unique=True, blank=True)` | Assigned by reservation service after creation |
| `title` | `CharField(max_length=256)` | |
| `description` | `TextField(blank=True)` | |
| `submitter_user` | `ForeignKey(User, null=True, blank=True, on_delete=SET_NULL)` | SET_NULL — data must survive if user leaves |
| `deposition_publications` | `TextField(blank=True)` | |
| `related_database_entries` | `TextField(blank=True)` | |
| `release_date` | `DateField(null=True, blank=True)` | |
| `authors_json` | `JSONField(default=list)` | `[{author_id, is_primary, is_corresponding, author_list_order}]`. author_id is a soft-reference to `users.Author` — NOT a DB FK. |
| `created_at`, `updated_at` | auto timestamps | |

### Dataset
FK → `Deposition`. FK → `cryo_grids.Sample` (on_delete=PROTECT). One deposition → N datasets. **Status lives here, not on Deposition.**

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `dataset_id` | `IntegerField(null=True, unique=True, blank=True)` | Assigned by reservation service |
| `deposition` | `ForeignKey(Deposition, on_delete=CASCADE)` | |
| `sample` | `ForeignKey("cryo_grids.Sample", null=True, blank=True, on_delete=PROTECT)` | Sample identity (organism, tissue, cell, strain, component, dev_stage, disease — each as _name + _id/ontology pair) lives on cryo_grids.Sample |
| `title`, `description` | `CharField` / `TextField` | |
| `sample_preparation`, `grid_preparation` | `TextField(blank=True)` | |
| `other_setup` | `TextField(blank=True)` | |
| `assay_label` | `CharField(blank=True)` | Experiment context — stays on Dataset, not Sample |
| `assay_ontology_id` | `CharField(blank=True)` | |
| `dataset_publications` | `TextField(blank=True)` | |
| `is_authors_same_as_deposition` | `BooleanField(default=True)` | |
| `authors_json` | `JSONField(default=list)` | Same shape as Deposition.authors_json; only used when `is_authors_same_as_deposition=False` |
| `status` | `CharField(choices=[draft/syncing/pushed/failed], default='draft', db_index=True)` | Per-dataset status |
| `related_database_entries` | `TextField(blank=True)` | |
| `created_at`, `updated_at` | auto timestamps | |

### cryo_grids.Sample (enriched fields — not in depositions app)
`cryo_grids.Sample` holds all sample identity fields: `sample_type`, `organism_name`, `organism_taxid` (IntegerField), `tissue_name`, `tissue_id`, `cell_name`, `cell_type_id`, `cell_strain_name`, `cell_strain_id`, `cell_component_name`, `ontology` (= cell_component_id), `development_stage_name`, `development_stage_ontology_id`, `disease_name`, `disease_ontology_id`.

### DepositionSession
FK → `Dataset`, FK → `MsiSession` (from `tem.models`). One dataset → N sessions.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `aretomo_run_name` | `CharField(max_length=20, blank=True)` | Run-name reference, NOT a FK |
| `denoise_run_name` | `CharField(max_length=20, blank=True)` | Blank = skipped |
| `subset_csv_path` | `CharField(blank=True)` | |
| `selected_copick_runs` | `JSONField(default=list)` | |
| `last_autofill_at` | `DateTimeField(null=True, blank=True)` | |
| `last_autofill_duration_seconds` | `IntegerField(null=True, blank=True)` | |
| `created_at`, `updated_at` | auto timestamps | |

### TiltseriesMetadata
OneToOne FK → `DepositionSession`.

Fields: `acceleration_voltage`, `spherical_aberration_constant`, `microscope_manufacturer`, `microscope_model`, `microscope_energy_filter`, `microscope_image_corrector`, `microscope_phase_plate`, `camera_manufacturer`, `camera_model`, `tilt_min`, `tilt_max`, `tilt_step`, `tilting_scheme`, `tilt_axis`, `total_flux`, `data_acquisition_software`, `pixel_spacing`, `is_aligned`, `aligned_tiltseries_binning`, `binning_from_frames` (FloatField), `tilt_series_quality` (IntegerField 1–5), `autofill_metadata` (JSONField default={}), `created_at`, `updated_at`.

### TomogramMetadata
OneToOne FK → `DepositionSession`.

Fields: `voxel_spacing`, `ctf_corrected`, `fiducial_alignment_status`, `reconstruction_method`, `reconstruction_software`, `processing`, `processing_software`, `is_visualization_default`, `autofill_metadata` (JSONField default={}), `created_at`, `updated_at`.

### DepositionAnnotation
FK → `DepositionSession`. unique_together = (session, copick_kind, copick_ref).

Fields: `copick_kind` (choices: picks/segmentations/meshes), `copick_ref`, `object_id`, `object_name`, `object_description` (optional), `object_state`, `object_count`, `annotation_method`, `annotation_software`, `annotation_publication`, `method_type` (choices: manual/automated/hybrid/simulated), `ground_truth_status`, `is_visualization_default`, `is_selected` (default=True), `created_at`, `updated_at`.

### DepositionAnnotationMethodLink
FK → `DepositionAnnotation`. Repeatable (one annotation → N links).

Fields: `link_type` (choices: documentation/models_weights/other/source_code/website), `link` (URLField), `custom_name`.

### DatasetFunding
FK → `Dataset`. Repeatable.

Fields: `funding_agency_name`, `grant_id`.

### DepositionJob
**OneToOne FK → `Dataset`** (one job per dataset, not per deposition). Tracks prep→push lifecycle.

Fields: `prep_slurm_job_id`, `push_slurm_job_id`, `state` (pending → prep_submitted → prep_running → prep_completed → push_submitted → push_running → completed/failed), `started_at`, `completed_at`, `log_excerpt`, `error_message`.

