## ReservationService (`umbrella/depositions/services/reservations.py`)

- `StubReservationService` — in-memory canned IDs starting at 10000. For dev.
- `LambdaReservationService` — calls reservation lambda via `httpx`. All 5 endpoints use GET.
- Toggle: `RESERVATION_LAMBDA_URL` env var. Unset → stub. Set → lambda.
- Always call `get_reservation_service()` factory — never instantiate directly.

Lambda endpoints (all GET):
- `GET /reservations/deposition/new` → `{"deposition_id": N}`
- `GET /reservations/dataset/new` → `{"dataset_id": N}`
- `GET /reservations/deposition/{id}` → `{"deposition_id", "instantiated", "reservation"}`
- `GET /reservations/dataset/{id}` → `{"dataset_id", "instantiated", "reservation"}`
- `GET /reservations[?detail=true]` → summary or full detail

---

## Dataset Metadata Builder (`umbrella/depositions/services/dataset_metadata.py`)
Serializes Dataset + CopickConfigs + Annotations to `dataprep_config.yaml`:
```yaml
output_dir: ...
deposition_id: ...
datasets:
  <dataset_label>:
    dataset_id: ...
    metadata: ...
    sessions:
      <session_name>:
        aretomo3_path: ...
        copick_configs: ...
        tiltseries: ...
        tomograms: ...
        annotations: ...
```
Generated fresh from DB before every cluster call. DB is always source-of-truth.

