## REST API Endpoints

**URL prefix**: `depositions/v1/` (registered as `path("depositions/", include("depositions.urls"))` in root urls.py). No `/api/` prefix — matches `tem/`, `copick/`, `workflow/` pattern.

### Depositions (container) — CRUD
| Method | URL | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/depositions/v1/depositions[?scope=mine]` | List (My Submissions) |
| POST | `/depositions/v1/depositions` | Create deposition (auto-reserves ID) |
| GET | `/depositions/v1/depositions/[id]` | Read deposition + datasets |
| PATCH | `/depositions/v1/depositions/[id]` | Auto-save: deposition fields + authors_json |
| DELETE | `/depositions/v1/depositions/[id]` | Delete (cascades) |

### Datasets (submit unit) — CRUD + actions
| Method | URL | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/depositions/v1/datasets` | Add dataset (auto-reserves ID) |
| GET | `/depositions/v1/datasets/[id]` | Read one dataset |
| PATCH | `/depositions/v1/datasets/[id]` | Auto-save: dataset fields + funding + session selection + authors_json (all nested) |
| DELETE | `/depositions/v1/datasets/[id]` | Delete dataset |
| POST | `/depositions/v1/datasets/[id]/submit` | Trigger DepositionPrepProcessor (per dataset) |
| GET | `/depositions/v1/datasets/[id]/job-status` | Poll status |
| GET | `/depositions/v1/datasets/[id]/logs` | View logs |
| GET | `/depositions/v1/datasets/[id]/config.yaml` | Download YAML |

### Sessions — detail save + per-session ops
| Method | URL | Description |
|---|---|---|
| PATCH | `/depositions/v1/sessions/[id]` | Auto-save: session + tiltseries/tomogram metadata + annotations (nested, upsert by copick_kind+copick_ref) |
| POST | `/depositions/v1/sessions/[id]/auto-fill` | SSH init, returns parsed values (prefill metadata) |
| POST | `/depositions/v1/sessions/[id]/subset-csv` | Upload subset CSV |

### Method links — own endpoint (avoids 2-level nesting)
| Method | URL | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/depositions/v1/annotations/[id]/method-links` | Add link to an annotation |
| PATCH | `/depositions/v1/method-links/[id]` | Edit link |
| DELETE | `/depositions/v1/method-links/[id]` | Remove link |

**Reservation API**: already implemented in the Lambda — no Embrella endpoint needed.
**Copick scan**: reuse existing `/copick/v1/projects/<session>/<run>/` endpoint.

---

## Registration in Root Config
In `umbrella/umbrella/settings.py` → `"depositions"` in `INSTALLED_APPS`.
In `umbrella/umbrella/urls.py` → `path("depositions/", include("depositions.urls"))`.

---

## Reused Infrastructure (do not reimplement)
| Concern | Existing tool |
|---|---|
| SSH connections | `clusterio.get_cluster_ssh_connection()` |
| SLURM submission | `BaseProcessor` (`sbatch`) |
| SLURM polling | `StatusChecker` (`squeue`) |
| Log fetching | `fetch_job_logs` |
| Syncer framework | `_start_syncer_task` (Django-Q) |
| Job state tracking | `PipeExecution` |
| Imaging sessions | `MsiSession` (from `tem.models`) |
| AreTomo run lookup | Existing endpoint (reuse) |
| DenoisET run lookup | Existing endpoint (reuse) |
| Cluster dir browser | `get_directory_files` |
| Copick scan | Extend existing `/copick/v1/projects/<session>/<run>/` endpoint |

Django-Q tasks live in `umbrella/depositions/tasks/deposition_tasks.py`. One syncer per active SLURM job per dataset, using `_start_syncer_task`.
